<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">WorldForge: Unlocking Emergent 3D/4D 
<br class="ltx_break">Generation in Video Diffusion Model via
<br class="ltx_break">Training-Free Guidance</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
